### ==============================================================================
### SISTEMA DE INVESTIGACIÓN CRIMINAL — EJEMPLOS DE API HTTP
### Rebanada C: Integrante C (Camilo Gutiérrez Castañeda)
### Compatible con REST Client (VS Code) o IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ==============================================================================

@host = http://localhost:4000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.ejemploToken
@caseId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
@suspectId = 987fcdeb-51a2-43f7-9876-543210987654

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK (Público)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{host}}/api/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTENTICACIÓN
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Registro de usuario estándar
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Detective Salazar",
  "email": "detective.salazar@policia.gob",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Inicio de sesión
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "detective.salazar@policia.gob",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Perfil del usuario actual
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. EXPEDIENTES (CASOS)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Listar casos
GET {{host}}/api/cases?page=1&limit=10&status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear caso
POST {{host}}/api/cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Homicidio en callejón noir",
  "description": "Hallazgo de cuerpo sin vida con signos de violencia en el sector bancario.",
  "location": "Sector Bancario Calle 45",
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-05T03:30:00.000Z",
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. SOSPECHOSOS (REBANADA C)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Listar sospechosos (con filtros combinados de búsqueda, estado y caso)
GET {{host}}/api/suspects?page=1&limit=10&caseId={{caseId}}&status=PERSON_OF_INTEREST&q=Carlos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar nuevo sospechoso en un caso
POST {{host}}/api/suspects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caseId": "{{caseId}}",
  "fullName": "Carlos 'El Lobo' Mendoza",
  "alias": "El Lobo",
  "description": "Visto merodeando la escena del crimen 15 minutos antes de los hechos.",
  "suspicionLevel": 85,
  "status": "PERSON_OF_INTEREST",
  "photoUrl": "https://supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/case-images/suspects/lobo.jpg"
}

### Consultar detalle de un sospechoso
GET {{host}}/api/suspects/{{suspectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar sospechoso (nivel de sospecha, estado, foto o descripción)
PUT {{host}}/api/suspects/{{suspectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Carlos Alberto Mendoza",
  "alias": "El Lobo Solitario",
  "description": "Detenido preventivamente tras hallazgo de huellas dactilares coincidentes.",
  "suspicionLevel": 95,
  "status": "DETAINED",
  "photoUrl": "https://supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/case-images/suspects/lobo-detained.jpg"
}

### Eliminar sospechoso (borrado lógico y desvinculación de evidencias asociadas)
DELETE {{host}}/api/suspects/{{suspectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. EVIDENCIAS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Listar evidencias de un caso
GET {{host}}/api/evidences?page=1&limit=10&caseId={{caseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SUBIDA DE ARCHIVOS (IMÁGENES A STORAGE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Subir imagen de sospechoso a Supabase Storage
POST {{host}}/api/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="folder"

suspects
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mugshot.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./mugshot.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
